  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c2d267b057669f54da106f121bf5e76b, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 164489220096
    m_Localized: There was a man who lost everything and wandered aimlessly for many
      years.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 170336079872
    m_Localized: Among ancient ruins he found a golden lamp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 172420648960
    m_Localized: From it emerged a radiant Genie, who offered to grant a single wish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 177554477056
    m_Localized: "\u201CI want to be King. I want a Kingdom of my own,\u201D the
      man replied."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 181543260160
    m_Localized: "The Genie answered: \u201CYour wish shall be granted. But no Kingdom
      is given without trials.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 184470884352
    m_Localized: "\u201CIf you truly wish to be King, enter this chamber now. Your
      Kingdom awaits you,\u201D the Genie invited him."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 186479955968
    m_Localized: Excited, the man entered the first chamber, only to find with disappointment
      that it was filled with chess pieces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 188791017472
    m_Localized: And then the Genie transformed the man into a chess King, whose
      skin fused with that of the board.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 190506487808
    m_Localized: Two hundred chambers of trial await the King. Two hundred trials
      to test the conviction of his desire. Two hundred trials to conquer his own
      Kingdom.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 193123733504
    m_Localized: Will you help this man become a true King? Will you be able to guide
      him?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
